{
  "_readme": [
    "Provenance for every image the marketing pages may use.",
    "",
    "A screenshot cannot be grepped, so it gets a record. The claim gate blocks",
    "assets whose record says they are unsafe, and warns on assets nobody has",
    "inspected. Filename bans in tools/gate-claims.mjs stay ACTIVE until iOS plans",
    "091 (verified badge) and 092 (game dates) land and the capture set is",
    "regenerated; only then are individual filename rules retired in favour of",
    "this manifest alone.",
    "",
    "WHAT IS DERIVED vs WHAT IS CLAIMED",
    "  bytes/width/height/sha256/fileModified  derived by --refresh from the file",
    "  fileModified                            the file's mtime. NOT the capture",
    "                                          date. Do not relabel it as one.",
    "  sourceBuild / capturedAt / sourceScreen null until the capture pipeline",
    "                                          records them. An invented build",
    "                                          number is worse than a null one.",
    "  contains*/dateBehavior/approved         set ONLY by someone who opened the",
    "                                          image, with who and when in `audit`.",
    "",
    "approvedForMarketing: true = inspected and safe. false = inspected and unsafe.",
    "null = nobody has looked, which is not the same as safe."
  ],
